<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-SPARTA ADVANCE OVER STURM GRAZ WITH 1-1 TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPARTA ADVANCE OVER STURM GRAZ WITH 1-1 TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Cup Winners Cup first</p>
<p>round, second leg match on Thursday:</p>
<p>Sparta Prague (Czech Republic) 1  Sturm Graz (Austria ) 1</p>
<p>(0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sparta - Michal Hornak (85th minute)</p>
<p>Sturm - Ivica Vastic (76th)</p>
<p>Aggregate score 3-3, Sparta wins with two away goals.</p>
</text>
